Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:18.25,flashback,YOUNG NOZEL (FB),0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:53.97,Ep Title,EP TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7F8FF&}Beyond Tenacity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:59.97,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Now that your saint stage has ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:02.98,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,you have no way of defeating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:09.48,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Even if you use another saint stage\Nattack, it will not reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:14.49,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,This whole area is now filled \Nwith my Decaying World spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:17.58,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,So no one is coming to save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:20.24,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,and even if they did, \Nthere's nothing they could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:23.00,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,That's enough reason for \Nyou to give up, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:25.85,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,This was quite fun, though, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:33.21,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Gaja?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:37.28,main,UNDINE,0,0,0,,Gaja!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:45.69,main,GAJA,0,0,0,,This won't hurt, but please \Nforgive me, Queen Loropechika.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.18,0:02:48.98,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,Lightning Magic: Pulsaranta.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:57.16,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,This will stop her movements \Nfor a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:02.91,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,On that day…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.67,0:03:08.23,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I swore that I would destroy our enemies \Nin your place and protect our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:10.84,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,And yet, six months ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.65,0:03:16.42,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I failed to stop Megicula and Vanica's \Nattack, and you were cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:21.85,flashback,GAJA (FB),0,0,0,,I'm so terribly sorry! I'm a \Nfailure as a Spirit Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.85,0:03:25.10,flashback,LOROPECHIKA (FB),0,0,0,,No, no, no! I'm still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.10,flashback,LOROPECHIKA (FB),0,0,0,,If you hadn't been there, \NI would've died.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:33.61,flashback,LOROPECHIKA (FB),0,0,0,,And the fact that none of our citizens \Nwere hurt makes me the happiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:35.61,flashback,LOROPECHIKA (FB),0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you, Gaja!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:43.73,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,Because I tried to protect the \Ncitizens, the kingdom… everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.73,0:03:45.64,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,you ended up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:49.37,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,You've been forced to do the one \Nthing you didn't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:54.55,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I've truly failed as a Spirit Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.15,0:03:58.80,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,Rather than the kingdom… \NI wanted to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.53,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I won't let them kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:03.79,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I won't let you kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:08.39,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I will not die from any \Ninjuries you inflict upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.93,0:04:13.82,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I will convert my very life into \Nmagic… and destroy this devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.07,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,Here and now…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.46,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,This time for sure, I will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:25.19,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,Ultimate Lightning Magic: \NApocalypra Astrauza!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.57,0:04:32.62,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,Decaying World can't erase all of—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:48.67,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Just one more attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.15,0:04:50.71,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,I don't care if it's weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:55.49,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,I just need enough saint stage \Npower to pierce its exposed heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.90,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,So this is a spell fueled by \Nburning the caster's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.30,0:05:06.54,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Its power far surpassed my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:11.16,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,That was magnificent, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.81,0:05:13.08,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,But unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:18.16,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,my body is under the protection of \Nan ultra-high-speed recovery curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.55,0:05:19.61,main,UNDINE,0,0,0,,Gaja!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:24.47,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Undine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.30,0:05:27.67,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,This is the same as our last fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:32.32,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Now you can't use your \Nsaint stage powers at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:34.73,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,This time… it's truly the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.49,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.66,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,"Not yet"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:55.39,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,There's clearly no way you can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:57.98,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,So why do you continue to struggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:03.13,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Could that be how humans occasionally \Nsurpass expectations and create spells?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:06.90,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,But there's no human alive who can produce
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:10.95,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,a spell capable of defeating \Nme within Decaying World.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:15.41,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Devils never disobey those whose \Nlevel is higher than their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.41,0:06:17.05,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Because it's absolutely futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:18.89,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,But you humans hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:23.52,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,to nonsensical ideas and risk your \Nlives for meaningless things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:28.41,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Acier Silva fought with love \Nfor her children as her weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:29.89,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,That man fought with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:33.41,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,loyalty to the queen to whom \Nhe'd sworn his allegiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:38.17,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,And you're fighting with hope \Nthat doesn't even exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.17,0:06:40.19,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,For the sake of something so petty…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:44.34,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Why cling to such things when it \Nwould be easier to just give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:52.63,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,There's no way I can win? \NI already know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:59.28,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,You're right… But that belongs to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:01.94,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,so I don't care if you \Ndon't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:06.93,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,What's with this devil, anyway? \NIt's absolutely insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.27,0:07:13.50,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,See, even if our chances \Nof winning are slim,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:15.85,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,there are times when humans \Njust have to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.66,0:07:20.71,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,The truth is, even now, I just want \Nto fall to my knees and cry…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:23.89,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,It's not as if we can win \Nas long as we don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:27.56,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,But if we give up, \Nwe have no hope of winning at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:30.06,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Still, even then…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:33.93,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Our strength lies in us not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.63,0:07:36.57,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.31,0:07:39.64,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,I still can't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:44.65,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,It's quite fascinating… but I can't \Nwaste any more time on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:52.41,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Curse-Warding Magic: Exploding Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:59.46,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,I will detonate Loropechika and kill \Nall the humans in this castle at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:02.13,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,And then…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.13,0:08:04.89,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,I will fully manifest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.44,0:08:17.59,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Loropechika!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:32.87,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Man, that was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:35.54,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,I barely made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.54,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,That's right…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:40.73,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,We saw each other again \Njust fine! Right, Noelle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:43.00,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,That's what you taught me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:48.43,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,I'm not fine at all, Stupidsta!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:55.14,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,What is that human?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.59,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Queen Loropechika…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:09:01.94,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,We stopped her from blowing up, but\Nshe still has all sorts of curses on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:05.44,main,LIEBE,0,0,0,,Only one gate to the underworld is open…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:08.44,main,LIEBE,0,0,0,,So what's a supreme devil doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:14.04,main,LIEBE,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be honest. We've got no chance \Nat winning without our devil union!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:18.41,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,He managed to do all that \Ninside Decaying World?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:24.41,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,I see. He must be the anti-magic human \Nthat Vanica and the others spoke of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:26.78,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,I'm quite intrigued,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:30.62,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,but he could conceivably bring about \Nthe most unthinkable situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.72,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,That's enough games.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:40.58,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,First, I'll kill Vanica and \NLoropechika for good…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:42.98,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,and then manifest completely right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:46.21,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:47.73,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,The curse runes vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:58.17,main,CHARLOTTE,0,0,0,,I'm still…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:10:01.00,main,CHARLOTTE,0,0,0,,standing right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:03.23,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,That woman… How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:05.58,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,She should have been beyond recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.84,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,Not only that, but her magic's increased!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:14.76,main,RILL,0,0,0,,This isn't the type of spell I'm used \Nto, so it took a while to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:24.55,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,While Twilight Valhalla is active,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:26.97,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,it boosts the magic of any \Ncompanions within its range
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.97,0:10:31.29,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,and makes it so they won't die, no \Nmatter how much damage they take!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:33.03,main,RILL,0,0,0,,We're invincible for just a few minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:36.40,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,Once it's over, the damage will come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:38.62,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,But who cares about that right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:41.81,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's awesome, Rill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.81,0:10:44.46,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,And I'm so glad you're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:48.92,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,If Asta hadn't shown up, I wouldn't have \Nmade it before that explosion hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:52.38,main,RILL,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I may achieve \Nmy ultimate masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.89,0:10:56.77,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,Individually, they're \Nutterly insignificant,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:59.59,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,but when they combine their strength, \Nthey can do all this…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:03.33,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,You humans truly are fascinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:14.53,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Dark disciples who died to amuse Vanica \Nand myself sleep below the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.84,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,I will imbue them with \Nthe power of devils,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.84,0:11:22.63,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,as well as that of Acier Silva and \NVanica, whose souls I hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:27.85,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Living corpses of blood and steel…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:34.60,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,One hundred in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:56.22,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Whoa! My body really does hurt all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:58.36,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Whoa! We're getting dragged in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:07.21,main,UNDINE,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving Loropechika!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.88,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,You're welcome! And thanks for saving us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:14.05,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Sorry! I'm absolutely useless right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:16.00,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,The rest is all yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:19.53,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Hello?! You just got here! \NWhat are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:21.80,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Noelle! You've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.64,0:12:24.13,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:27.89,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,I'm sure you were plenty \Nreckless as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:29.98,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,You've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.81,0:12:32.78,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Just the fact that you came…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:36.13,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Just thinking about you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:39.44,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,gives me strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.81,0:12:43.62,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Ah, so it's true, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.42,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,I've been making excuses until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.81,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,but to think I'd realize \Nit at a time like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:53.75,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,I guess I must love Asta.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:56.49,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,But right now, we're on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:59.26,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Right now, I'm going to defeat Megicula!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.51,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Let's go, Undine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.86,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Final saint stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:13.44,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Whoa! You're so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:16.69,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Take care of Loropechika, Asta!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:18.44,main,ASTA,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:26.18,main,UNDINE,0,0,0,,We don't have enough saint stage \Npower to deal with this whole army!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.25,0:13:30.26,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,Picture Magic: Master of Valhalla.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:34.02,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,Noelle with her saint stage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:37.53,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,and Charlotte with her special \Nanti-curse attack are both vital!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:41.84,main,RILL,0,0,0,,Meaning I'll have to provide solid backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.84,0:13:45.65,italics,CHARLOTTE (INT),0,0,0,,True Briar Magic: Crimson Vine Spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:52.04,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,You humans just keep \Nevolving during battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.65,0:13:56.11,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,You're truly…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:07.00,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,the ultimate playthings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:13.87,main,RILL,0,0,0,,Noelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:25.14,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,Luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:27.76,main,LUCK,0,0,0,,I'll clear a path, so follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.07,0:14:29.86,main,RILL,0,0,0,,This is great, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:33.22,main,RILL,0,0,0,,Inspiration just keeps \Nwelling up inside me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.22,0:14:35.52,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,If there were one more lightning \Nmage to show us the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.81,0:14:37.77,italics,RILL (INT),0,0,0,,this would be even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:50.29,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I'm basically dead already…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:54.62,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,But even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:59.50,italics,GAJA (INT),0,0,0,,I'm grateful that I get to fight \Nfor Queen Loropechika again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.71,main,LUCK,0,0,0,,Gaja!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:07.63,main,LUCK,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:08.81,main,GAJA,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:24.82,italics,NOELLE (INT),0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:34.79,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Even if I'm still incomplete,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.79,0:15:37.40,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,you were able to press me this hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.84,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,I'm truly surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:43.31,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,But still…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.68,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.57,0:16:03.96,main,NOZEL,0,0,0,,How dare you show up in \Nfront of my family again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:11.55,main,NOZEL,0,0,0,,You have no idea how long I've \Nbeen waiting for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:22.84,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,After the curse was set on \NMother, she rapidly wasted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.42,0:16:25.85,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,The members of our family had no idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:28.43,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,so they just thought it \Nwas from the recent birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:32.84,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,When the curse-warding \Nspell was cast on Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:35.39,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,I was hit with a secondary effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:39.51,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,If I told anyone that Megicula \Nwas involved in Acier Silva's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:40.97,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,I would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:46.75,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,If I told someone, the one who \Nheard it would also be cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:49.97,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,It was a spell that spread like a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:53.35,flashback italics,YOUNG NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I can't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:55.89,flashback italics,YOUNG NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I just have to do something \Nabout it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:58.07,flashback italics,YOUNG NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I have to save Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:17:00.51,flashback italics,YOUNG NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I have to find a way to break the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:03.59,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,Nozel… That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:11.22,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,If you keep this up, your life \Nwill be in danger, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:12.97,flashback,YOUNG NOZEL (FB),0,0,0,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:16.89,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,People can't become strong so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:21.37,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:25.72,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,You… All of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.76,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,will be stronger than me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:31.85,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,So live…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:34.06,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,Nozel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:48.13,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,A year after being cursed, Mother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:54.59,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,For that year, all I could \Ndo was watch helplessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:00.10,flashback italics,YOUNG NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,Stronger…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:06.30,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I have to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:13.73,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,So I can avenge Mother someday! \NTo protect my siblings!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:18.22,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,Nebra and Solid are also getting stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.57,0:18:21.37,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,but they're no match for \Nan opponent like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:22.96,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,And Noelle…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:26.88,flashback,NOELLE (FB),0,0,0,,Nozel… Would you teach me magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.93,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,If there's no chance that \Nshe'll get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:32.88,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,it would be best to lock her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:37.72,flashback,NOZEL (FB),0,0,0,,Failures like you aren't \Nneeded on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:41.10,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,If she's just going to end \Nup feeling the way I do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.95,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I should distance her from the fight…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:49.85,flashback,NOZEL (FB),0,0,0,,Why did Mother have to die giving \Nbirth to someone like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.41,0:18:53.93,flashback,NOZEL (FB),0,0,0,,You killed Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:56.99,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:18:59.48,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:03.62,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I'm useless and I couldn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:07.25,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I was afraid of losing more, \Nso I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:10.14,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I'm just a coward with no \Nresolve to protect anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:15.77,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,At this point, I have no right \Nto involve myself with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.14,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,Stronger…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:21.56,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,Stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:28.56,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,The logical move was to try \Nto become the Wizard King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:33.68,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I can't die here…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.36,0:19:38.11,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,I managed to fight enemies with \Nevil magic like that devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:41.49,flashback italics,NOZEL (INT)(FB),0,0,0,,In which case, for the sake of \Nthe time that's bound to come…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.45,0:19:48.25,main,NOZEL,0,0,0,,I want…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:52.42,main,NOZEL,0,0,0,,to thank everyone here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:02.06,main,NOZEL,0,0,0,,We finally… meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:05.85,main,NOZEL,0,0,0,,Everything I've ever been or \Nhad is going into this attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:14.36,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,A touching reunion… \NIs that what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:24.29,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't have \Nemotions like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:31.46,flashback,ACIER (FB),0,0,0,,You have the strength of steel \Nand the flexibility of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:33.42,main,NOZEL,0,0,0,,Don't think you can block this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.47,0:20:39.63,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,Blood is flying… and \Nsteel is getting through…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:44.14,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,But even so, I can't destroy their heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:47.56,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,I guess I was wrong after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:51.06,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,I shouldn't have locked her \Naway or kept her out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.05,0:20:56.07,italics,NOZEL (INT),0,0,0,,We needed to grow stronger together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:02.87,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,We didn't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:06.24,main,NOELLE,0,0,0,,That's why we win this battle, Megicula!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:19.52,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,I was on my guard, but I figured \NI wouldn't lose to humans…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.38,0:21:29.02,main,MEGICULA,0,0,0,,It seems I misjudged…\Nyour true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.24,0:21:33.31,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,Is that why I let myself \Ntake an interest…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.31,0:21:37.21,italics,MEGICULA (INT),0,0,0,,in the power of human emotions?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:56.38,main,ACIER,0,0,0,,You two… have gotten so strong.

